  "description": "AERO BUILT\n\nThe Kamm Tail-shaped frame and are designed to achieve excellent aero performance. The aerodynamic seat post with a double clamp is designed for additional power savings on flat stages.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT\n\nThe Core Carbon has been built using the HCIM-Hollow Core technology featured in BH's high-end frames. The aim is to build a frame that is as lightweight and compact as possible with outstanding performance.\n\nNO CABLES\n\nThe road and gravel bike range features the ACR system, thus ensuring 100% internal cabling.\n\nMOTOR BHZ BY SEG AUTOMOTIVE\n\nExperience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance.\n\nTHE FREEDOM TO COVER MILES\n\nThe down tube houses a 630 Wh battery which can last for up to 150 km. ADDITIONAL XPRO BATTERY, PLUG & RIDE: This adds 180 Wh of capacity, meaning a total of 810 Wh and a range of up to 195 km.\n\nCORE HEART\n\nThe Core display is fully integrated into the stem and it features a button that allows you to increase or reduce the assistance level, through an LED colour system. Among other options, the Core App allows the user to switch between the motor's assistance modes whenever they like.\n\niBUTTONS\n\nTwo coin-sized wireless Bluetooth buttons that can be mounted anywhere on the handlebar with elastic bands, even under bar tape. Battery- powered wireless operation connects seamlessly via Bluetooth to your bike's system for instant control access.",
